  "notes": "WRITING:\n{播|は} means \"to sow\" or \"to spread.\" This is a relatively uncommon kanji.\n\nAGRICULTURAL TERMS:\n- {播種|はしゅ} - sowing, seeding\n- ⟦{発芽|はつが}→発芽：18956_hatsuga⟧ - germination\n- ⟦{苗|なえ}→苗：05489_nae⟧ - seedling\n- {定植|ていしょく} - transplanting\n\nMEDICAL USAGE:\nIn oncology, {播種|はしゅ} refers to cancer spreading to body cavities like the {腹膜|ふくまく} (peritoneum). This is different from ⟦{転移|てんい}→転移：14394_teni⟧ (metastasis) through the bloodstream or lymphatic system.",
